          "evidence": "explicit"
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "instruction": "Preheat the wok over medium heat until it just starts to smoke. Then add 2 tablespoons of oil and immediately add the eggs. Scramble the eggs and remove from the wok immediately. Set aside.",
